{"choices":[{"finish_reason":"stop","index":0,"message":{"role":"assistant","content":"My dear Marie,\n\nI am here in Brussels, with the kind Mr. van Ghert, who has received me with the greatest friendliness. The city is large, but the streets still confuse me. Last evening, as I hurried to the post office to look for news from you, the office was already closed – a small inconvenience that spoiled my evening.\n\nMy only news from you is still the letter from Kassel, which I brought with me. I am now waiting impatiently for the postman; within an hour I hope to learn whether any further letters have arrived. Until then, I sit here, drink a glass of wine, and try to endure the heat.\n\nThink of me, my wife, and forgive me that I have so little time to write to you in more detail. I will answer immediately tomorrow morning, as soon as I know whether everything is in order.\n\nYour faithful G. W. F. Hegel"}}],"created":1795221061,"model":"qwen","system_fingerprint":"b11429-d81235049","object":"chat.completion","usage":{"completion_tokens":193,"prompt_tokens":290,"total_tokens":483,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0}},"id":"chatcmpl-WIHamYot7HIAF5A3JKrD3ONgts74vCS1","timings":{"cache_n":0,"prompt_n":290,"prompt_ms":513.135,"prompt_per_token_ms":1.7694310344827586,"prompt_per_second":565.1534196653903,"predicted_n":193,"predicted_ms":4503.8,"predicted_per_token_ms":23.457291666666666,"predicted_per_second":42.63066743638705}}